 heme is Sanctuary\, explored through the lens of mental health: a sanctuar
 y can be a place\, a person\, a practice\, a memory\, or something else. B
 eyond the grant\, selected teams receive regular production meetings and s
 tory consultations\, industry mentor connections\, feedback from mental he
 alth professionals\, festival strategy development\, and distribution thro
 ugh Art Opening Minds' festival and a network of 350+ educational partners
  that integrate the films into curricula. Films must be exactly five minut
 es. TIMELINE: grants awarded late October 2026\, production from November\
