  engagement. No application fee.\nDuration: Commission period not specifie
 d\; permanent artworks for both hospital sites.\n\nMore: https://www.artra
 bbit.com/artist-opportunities/2026/september/rbharts-artist-open-call-orga
 n-donation-artworks?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=refer
 ral
