SUMMARY:Deadline: CultureAndHealth Platform x PASMO Foundation: National Ca
 ll #2 for Arts and Health Projects (Poland)
DESCRIPTION:The EU co-funded CultureAndHealth Platform\, with the PASMO Fou
 ndation as national delivery partner\, funds artists residing in Poland to
  deliver new arts-and-health projects developed in cooperation with a part
 ner organisation from the health\, education or social sector\; a letter o
 f intent from that partner is required. Projects should engage diverse par
 ticipant groups\, combine artistic activity with health promotion and prev
 ention\, and treat participants as co-creators rather than audiences. WHAT
  YOU GET: PLN 15\,000 gross per project\, professional consultation\, acce
 ss to the international CultureAndHealth network\, and presentation opport
 unities. ELIGIBILITY: artists residing in Poland\, at any career stage. AP
 PLICATION: through the PASMO Foundation website (www.pasmo.org.pl)\; a fre
 e info session is offered. DEADLINE: 30 September 2026. The platform runs 
 a rolling series of national calls across Europe\, with new national and E
 uropean calls expected to open in December 2026 and January 2027.\n\nOrgan
 isation: CultureAndHealth Platform (EU co-funded) with PASMO Foundation\nL
 ocation: Poland. Open to artists residing in Poland\, all career stages.\n
 Award: PLN 15\,000 gross per selected project\, plus professional consulta
 tion\, access to the international CultureAndHealth network and presentati
 on opportunities. No application fee.\nDuration: Project-based\; duration 
 not specified.\n\nMore: https://www.cultureandhealth.eu/calls/national-cal
 l-for-proposals-2-supporting-new-arts-and-health-projects-in-poland/?utm_s
 ource=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
