 lobal Grant for Emerging Creatives)
DESCRIPTION:Creatives for Our Future is the Swarovski Foundation's global g
 rant programme for emerging creatives aged 21 to 30. Each selected partici
 pant receives a EUR 20\,000 grant to support their creative project\, alon
 gside a mentorship and education programme. DISCIPLINES: fashion\, design\
 , art\, architecture and engineering\, which makes it a direct fit for fas
 hion-tech\, wearable and smart-textile projects. ELIGIBILITY: applicants m
 ust be aged 21 to 30 at the time of application and working on an initiati
 ve that uses creativity to accelerate awareness\, technology\, or solution
 s toward the UN Sustainable Development Goals\; open worldwide. DEADLINE: 
 9 November 2026 at 11:59 pm BST.\n\nOrganisation: Swarovski Foundation\nLo
 cation: Worldwide. Open to creatives aged 21 to 30 at the time of applicat
 ion.\nAward: EUR 20\,000 grant per selected participant\, plus a mentorshi
 p and education programme. No application fee.\nDuration: Grant plus accom
 panying mentorship programme.\n\nMore: https://creatives.swarovskifoundati
 on.org/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
