DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261006
SUMMARY:Deadline: 2027 LOOP Open Call for Exhibition Proposals (Seoul)
DESCRIPTION:Alternative Space LOOP in Seoul invites proposals for exhibitio
 ns to be presented as part of its 2027 programme. LOOP no longer separates
  artists\, curators and other types of applicants: proposals are welcome f
 rom individuals and teams\, across all genres and media\, and in any exhib
 ition format\, including solo exhibitions\, group exhibitions and curatori
 al projects. LOOP looks for projects that explore new approaches to exhibi
 tion-making and reflect on the social role of contemporary art. SUPPORT: a
  project grant of KRW 1\,000\,000\, exhibition space at Alternative Space 
 LOOP\, curatorial and operational support\, exhibition graphic design and 
 promotion\, use of LOOP's available equipment\, and connections to LOOP's 
 future projects and its local and international networks. SELECTION: 1-2 i
 ndividuals or teams\; interviews with shortlisted applicants mid October 2
 026\, final selection announced late October 2026. HOW TO APPLY: download 
 the application form via the Google Form\, complete it\, and upload it to 
 the same form as a PDF of no more than 25 pages\, named '2027 LOOP Open Ca
 ll_Applicant Name.pdf'. DEADLINE: 5 October 2026 at 24:00 KST.\n\nOrganisa
 tion: Alternative Space LOOP\nLocation: Alternative Space LOOP\, Seoul\, S
 outh Korea. Open to individuals and teams across all genres and media\; no
  separation between artists\, curators and other applicants.\nAward: Proje
 ct grant of KRW 1\,000\,000\, plus exhibition space at Alternative Space L
 OOP\, curatorial and operational support\, exhibition graphic design and p
 romotion\, and use of LOOP's available equipment. 1-2 individuals or teams
  are selected. No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: Exhibition realise
 d as part of LOOP's 2027 programme\, developed in close collaboration with
  LOOP\n\nMore: http://altspaceloop.com/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantd
 esk&utm_medium=referral
URL:http://altspaceloop.com/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medi
 um=referral
LOCATION:Alternative Space LOOP\, Seoul\, South Korea. Open to individuals 
 and teams across all genres and media\; no separation between artists\, cu
 rators and other applicants.
