DTSTAMP:20261031T115742Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260930
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261001
SUMMARY:Deadline: Gurl Grant: USD 2\,500 for female and non-binary short fi
 lm directors
DESCRIPTION:The Gurl Grant\, founded by filmmaker Kat VanCleave in 2025\, p
 uts money directly into the hands of female and non-binary film directors.
  Twice a year it awards a USD 2\,500 cash grant toward the production of a
  narrative short film made with a majority women or non-binary crew. ELIGI
 BILITY: female-identifying and non-binary film directors who have taken th
 e 51% Pledge\, a good-faith commitment to dedicate 51% of filmmaking resou
 rces to traditionally underrepresented filmmakers (women\, BIPOC\, LGBTQIA
 2S+)\; narrative short scripts of 15 pages or fewer\; no major studio affi
 liations or distribution deals\; directors may win only once per calendar 
 year and submit once per cycle. HOW TO APPLY: a single PDF with a one-page
  cover letter\, the script (max 15 pages)\, a completed 51% Pledge certifi
 cate and a pitch deck. No application fee. Submissions are capped at 100 e
 ntries per cycle\, first come first served. Winnings are distributed by AC
 H transfer. DEADLINE: 30 September 2026 at 11:55 PM EST\, or earlier once 
 100 submissions are received.\n\nOrganisation: Gurl Grant (Kat VanCleave)\
 nLocation: Online application. For female-identifying and non-binary film 
 directors who have taken the 51% Pledge\; winnings are paid by ACH transfe
 r.\nAward: USD 2\,500 cash grant toward the production of a narrative shor
 t film\, awarded twice yearly. No application fee.\n\nMore: https://www.ka
 tvancleave.com/grant?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=refe
 rral
URL:https://www.katvancleave.com/grant?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdes
 k&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Online application. For female-identifying and non-binary film dir
 ectors who have taken the 51% Pledge\; winnings are paid by ACH transfer.
END:VEVENT
