SUMMARY:Deadline: Manitoba Arts Council: Create Grant (October 2026 intake)
DESCRIPTION:Research and creation of new work\, or development of works in 
 progress\, by professional artists in all disciplines including media arts
 \; creation-based residencies are also fundable. Professional fees and hon
 orariums are a required budget line\, so the money genuinely pays the arti
 st. Amounts rise with career stage: up to CAD 7\,500 (emerging)\, CAD 10\,
 000 (mid-career) or CAD 15\,000 (established). ELIGIBILITY: individuals mu
 st have been resident in Manitoba for at least one year. Deadlines recur (
 March 20 and October 10)\; this round closes 10 October 2026.\n\nOrganisat
 ion: Manitoba Arts Council\nLocation: Manitoba\, Canada. Applicants must h
 ave been Manitoba residents for at least one year.\nAward: Emerging: up to
  CAD 7\,500\; Mid-career: up to CAD 10\,000\; Established: up to CAD 15\,0
 00. No application fee.\nDuration: Per project\n\nMore: https://artscounci
 l.mb.ca/grants/create/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=re
 ferral
