UID:cnc-creation-immersive-2026-oct@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261031T115742Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261012
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261013
SUMMARY:Deadline: CNC: Fonds d'aide a la creation immersive (October 2026 s
 ession)
DESCRIPTION:The CNC's flagship fund for immersive creation (successor to DI
 CReAM since 2022): VR\, mixed reality and interactive narrative works\, as
 sessed by a commission chaired by Jean-Michel Jarre. Four strands cover th
 e whole chain: writing (ecriture)\, preproduction\, production and portage
  (bringing a finished work to audiences). AMOUNTS: the aid page states per
 centage caps rather than fixed sums\; CNC's published results pages for 20
 25 show writing grants of EUR 10\,000 to 12\,000\, preproduction up to EUR
  60\,000 and production up to EUR 80\,000. ELIGIBILITY: individual authors
  who are French nationals or legal residents of an EU/EEA state\, so Nethe
 rlands-based authors qualify\; companies and associations must be establis
 hed in France\; the project must be conceived/written in French and at lea
 st 50% of expenses must be in France. The fund runs four sessions per year
 \; this session closes 12 October 2026 (commission December 2026).\n\nOrga
 nisation: CNC (Centre national du cinema et de l'image animee)\nLocation: 
 France. Individual authors may be French nationals or residents of EU/EEA 
 states (Netherlands-based eligible)\; companies must be established in Fra
 nce\; writing must be in French and at least 50% of expenses spent in Fran
 ce.\nAward: Selective aid in four strands: ecriture\, preproduction\, prod
 uction and portage. The call page publishes percentage caps (up to 50% of 
 French financing\, 80% by derogation)\; CNC's own published commission res
 ults show ecriture grants of EUR 10\,000 to 12\,000\, preproduction up to 
 EUR 60\,000 and production up to EUR 80\,000. No application fee.\nDuratio
 n: Per project\n\nMore: https://www.cnc.fr/professionnels/aides-et-finance
 ments/creation-numerique/fonds-daide-a-la-creation-immersive_1725797?utm_s
 ource=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.cnc.fr/professionnels/aides-et-financements/creation-numeri
 que/fonds-daide-a-la-creation-immersive_1725797?utm_source=artificialnouve
 augrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:France. Individual authors may be French nationals or residents of
  EU/EEA states (Netherlands-based eligible)\; companies must be establishe
 d in France\; writing must be in French and at least 50% of expenses spent
  in France.
END:VEVENT
