SUMMARY:Deadline: Federation Wallonie-Bruxelles: Bourses et aides aux proje
 ts en Arts numeriques (15 October 2026 session)
DESCRIPTION:The French Community of Belgium's public funding line specifica
 lly for digital arts. Two instruments: bourses for individual creation or 
 research (EUR 1\,000 to 15\,000) and aides au projet for conception\, prod
 uction\, promotion or diffusion of a digital-arts project (EUR 1\,000 to 5
 0\,000). Applications go through the SUBside platform. ELIGIBILITY: indivi
 duals (artists\, curators) professionally active in digital arts\, domicil
 ed or resident in Wallonia or Brussels-Capital\, with activity mainly addr
 essed to French Community audiences. Deposits recur three times a year (15
  June\, 15 October\, 15 March)\; this session closes 15 October 2026.\n\nO
 rganisation: Federation Wallonie-Bruxelles\, Service de la Creation artist
 ique (Direction des Arts visuels)\nLocation: Wallonia and Brussels-Capital
 \, Belgium. Applicants must be domiciled/resident there and professionally
  active in digital arts.\nAward: Bourses (creation or research\, individua
 ls only): EUR 1\,000 to 15\,000. Aides au projet (conception\, production\
 , promotion\, diffusion): EUR 1\,000 to 50\,000. No application fee.\nDura
 tion: Per project\n\nMore: https://creationartistique.cfwb.be/demarche/436
 4_demander_une_bourse_en_arts_numeriques?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrant
 desk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://creationartistique.cfwb.be/demarche/4364_demander_une_bourse_en
 _arts_numeriques?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Wallonia and Brussels-Capital\, Belgium. Applicants must be domici
 led/resident there and professionally active in digital arts.
END:VEVENT
