 talled at the 2027 event). Open internationally to individuals and collect
 ives\; artist attendance is recommended but not required.\nAward: USD 1.5 
 million annual art-grant budget across approximately 75 projects\; grants 
 fund 40 to 60% of the proposed total budget\, and the official page notes 
