SUMMARY:Deadline: Auslandsstipendien von Bund und Laendern 2028 (Villa Mass
 imo\, Casa Baldi\, Venice\, Paris)
DESCRIPTION:Germany's flagship residency awards for visual artists\, archit
 ects\, writers and composers\, administered by the Kulturstiftung der Laen
 der for the federal government. One application window covers the Rome Pri
 ze at Villa Massimo (10 months\, EUR 3\,000/month\, international visibili
 ty expected)\, Casa Baldi in Olevano Romano (3 months\, EUR 3\,000/month)\
 , the Deutsches Studienzentrum in Venice (3 months\, EUR 1\,534/month) and
  a 6-month Paris residency (approx. EUR 1\,500/month). Accommodation and s
