DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270301
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270302
SUMMARY:Deadline: Kooperativa x Flanders Arts Institute: South-Eastern Euro
 pe Mobility Programme 2026-27
DESCRIPTION:Flanders Arts Institute and the Kooperativa network offer fifte
 en mobility grants for Flanders-based artists and arts professionals in th
 e visual arts\, performing arts\, music and sound to immerse themselves in
  the South-Eastern European arts sector. Participants spend 3 to 5 days jo
 b shadowing at one organisation in Bosnia and Herzegovina\, Montenegro\, C
 roatia\, Kosovo\, North Macedonia\, Serbia or Slovenia\, with mobility act
 ions between 1 October 2026 and 30 June 2027. WHAT YOU GET: travel costs\,
  accommodation and per diems per Erasmus+ formulas\, plus up to EUR 300 fo
 r the host to cover any costs they might incur. ELIGIBILITY: artists and a
 rts professionals based in Flanders\, Belgium. APPLICATION: two steps\; fi
 rst email ward@kunsten.be with an outline of the project status\, then sub
 mit a letter of intent from the host\, visit planning\, motivation and a d
 escription of the reporting format. Applications are reviewed in monthly c
 ycles (8 September\, 8 October\, 9 November\, 8 December 2026\; 15 January
 \, 8 February\, 8 March 2027) and are accepted until 1 March 2027. AFTERWA
 RDS: participants share their experience through a written report\, video\
 , talk or recording on an online platform.\n\nOrganisation: Flanders Arts 
 Institute (Kunstenpunt) and Kooperativa\nLocation: Job shadowing at arts o
 rganisations in Bosnia and Herzegovina\, Montenegro\, Croatia\, Kosovo\, N
 orth Macedonia\, Serbia or Slovenia. Open to artists and arts professional
 s based in Flanders (Belgium) only.\nAward: Fully funded mobility: travel 
 costs\, accommodation and per diems calculated per Erasmus+ formulas\, plu
 s up to EUR 300 for the host organisation's costs. Fifteen grants availabl
 e. No application fee.\nDuration: 3 to 5 days of job shadowing at one orga
 nisation\, with mobility actions taking place between 1 October 2026 and 3
 0 June 2027.\n\nMore: https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/kooperativa-x-fai-mo
 bility-programme-immerse-yourself-in-the-southeastern-european-arts-sector
 /?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.kunsten.be/en/calls/kooperativa-x-fai-mobility-programme-im
 merse-yourself-in-the-southeastern-european-arts-sector/?utm_source=artifi
 cialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Job shadowing at arts organisations in Bosnia and Herzegovina\, Mo
 ntenegro\, Croatia\, Kosovo\, North Macedonia\, Serbia or Slovenia. Open t
 o artists and arts professionals based in Flanders (Belgium) only.
END:VEVENT
