 y VIA's three core values of Artistic Production\, Thought Leadership\, an
 d Public Engagement. Two-stage application process: Letter of Inquiry due 
 5 November 2026\; invitations to submit a full application sent 15 Decembe
 r 2026 (by invitation only)\; full application deadline for invited applic
 ants 25 January 2027\; grant award notification April 2027. Projects must 
 start after 15 June 2027. VIA runs Fall and Spring cycles each year\; Spri
 ng 2027 is the current open call. Start with the eligibility form linked f
 rom the apply page\; full program description\, eligibility requirements a
 nd LOI guidelines are in the program PDF.\n\nOrganisation: VIA Art Fund\nL
 ocation: Worldwide (projects exhibited beyond museum walls\, in the public
