DTSTAMP:20261031T115742Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261102
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261103
SUMMARY:Deadline: Lendhauer: Urban Ecologies - Coexistence and Control (Len
 dhafen\, Klagenfurt 2027)
DESCRIPTION:The Klagenfurt association Lendhauer invites proposals for artw
 orks at the Lendhafen\, the city's harbour\, under the 2027 theme Urban Ec
 ologies: Coexistence and Control. The call asks who or what counts as usef
 ul or disruptive in public space\, who is included or excluded\, and wheth
 er peaceful coexistence is achievable\, treating urban space as networks o
 f diverse relationships between human and non-human actors. Both fully dev
 eloped artistic works and experimental\, process-based or collaborative ap
 proaches are welcome. WHAT YOU GET: production costs up to EUR 4\,000 gros
 s (exact amount depends on project scope)\, an artist fee up to EUR 2\,500
  gross\, travel expenses up to EUR 1\,000\, and on-site coordination of te
 chnical and organisational requirements including permits. ELIGIBILITY: ar
 tists\, designers\, architects\, performers\, theorists and practitioners 
 working in interdisciplinary contexts\; individuals and collectives\, base
 d in Austria or abroad\; disciplines listed are architecture\, performing 
 arts\, and visual arts and design. Projects are realised June to end of Se
 ptember 2027. DEADLINE: 2 November 2026. Full details and application via 
 lendhafen.at.\n\nOrganisation: Lendhauer (Klagenfurt\, Austria)\nLocation:
  Lendhafen harbour\, Klagenfurt\, Austria. Open to individuals and collect
 ives based in Austria or abroad.\nAward: Artist fee up to EUR 2\,500 gross
 \, production costs up to EUR 4\,000 gross (depending on project scope)\, 
 and travel expenses up to EUR 1\,000. No application fee.\nDuration: Proje
 cts realised at the Lendhafen between June and the end of September 2027.\
 n\nMore: https://www.lendhafen.at/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&u
 tm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.lendhafen.at/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_med
 ium=referral
LOCATION:Lendhafen harbour\, Klagenfurt\, Austria. Open to individuals and 
 collectives based in Austria or abroad.
