 lnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261031T115742Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261119
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261120
SUMMARY:Deadline: Arts Council of Ireland: Festivals Investment Scheme 2027
 \, Round 2
DESCRIPTION:The Arts Council of Ireland's Festivals Investment Scheme funds
  small to mid-scale arts festivals whose programmes engage local communiti
 es or communities of interest\, across all artforms including multidiscipl
 inary\, digital and performance programmes. Round 2 of the 2027 scheme is 
 for festivals later in 2027 (Round 1\, which closed in May 2026\, covered 
 festivals from January to June 2027). WHO: organisations delivering an art
 s festival programme in the Republic of Ireland. WHAT YOU GET: a grant of 
 up to EUR 45\,000 towards the festival programme\, in three bands by scale
 . APPLICATION: through the Arts Council online services portal\; guideline
 s and budget templates are on the scheme page. Opened 20 October 2026. DEA
 DLINE: 19 November 2026 at 17:30.\n\nOrganisation: Arts Council of Ireland
  / An Chomhairle Ealaion\nLocation: Republic of Ireland. For organisations
  delivering arts festivals in Ireland.\nAward: Up to EUR 45\,000 per festi
 val. Round 1 used three bands: Band A up to EUR 10\,000\, Band B EUR 10\,0
 01 to 25\,000\, Band C EUR 25\,001 to 45\,000. No application fee.\nDurati
 on: Round 2 covers festivals taking place in the second half of 2027 (Roun
 d 1 covered 1 January to 30 June 2027\; confirm exact dates in the Round 2
  guidelines). Opened 20 October 2026.\n\nMore: https://www.artscouncil.ie/
 funding-opportunities/festivals-investment-scheme-round-2/?utm_source=arti
 ficialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.artscouncil.ie/funding-opportunities/festivals-investment-s
 cheme-round-2/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Republic of Ireland. For organisations delivering arts festivals i
 n Ireland.
END:VEVENT
