  25 February 2027\, up to AUD 30\,000)
DESCRIPTION:Screen Australia's Emerging Gamemakers Fund backs early-career 
 Australian game makers with small grants to build a prototype or to finish
  and release a micro-scale original game. WHO: Australian citizens and per
 manent residents applying as individuals\, or incorporated companies carry
 ing on business in Australia with central management and control in Austra
 lia\; all applicants need an ABN and must control the rights to the projec
 t with a clear chain of title. Projects must have budgets of up to AUD 500
 \,000 at the time of applying. WHAT YOU GET: up to AUD 30\,000. APPLICATIO
 N: via SmartyGrants\; the next round opens 14 December 2026 and the fund i
 s scheduled to run as rounds until financial year 2026/27. DEADLINE: 5pm A
 EDT\, Thursday 25 February 2027.\n\nOrganisation: Screen Australia\nLocati
 on: Australia. Individuals must be Australian citizens or permanent reside
 nts\; companies must be incorporated and run from Australia. ABN required.
 \nAward: Up to AUD 30\,000 per project. No application fee.\nDuration: Pro
 totype creation or completion and release of a micro-scale game with a tot
 al budget of up to AUD 500\,000. Round opens 14 December 2026\; outcomes a
 bout 12 weeks after the deadline.\n\nMore: https://www.screenaustralia.gov
 .au/fund/emerging-gamemakers-fund-2/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk
