DESCRIPTION:France Culture and LaScam offer two EUR 5\,000 grants (Brouillo
 n d'un reve) to write a first creative audio documentary in the spirit of 
 L'Experience\, France Culture's strand of auteur sound documentaries. The 
 target format is a 57'30 documentary for broadcast or a native podcast ser
 ies with variable episode length. WHO: authors writing their first creativ
 e audio documentary\, in French\; reportage\, news programmes and more cla
 ssic documentaries are excluded. WHAT YOU GET: EUR 5\,000 to fund the writ
 ing\; production and inclusion in France Culture's output are decided sepa
 rately afterwards by its Fictions et Creation department. APPLICATION: ema
 il bourses.documentaires@radiofrance.com with a 5-line summary (max 500 ch
 aracters)\, the intended duration\, a two-page PDF (statement of intent pl
 us a note on the sound design)\, names\, detailed CV and contact details\,
  optional links to earlier work\, and an IBAN. The committee meets in mid-
 January 2027 and results are announced by 5 February 2027. Submission wind
 ow: 20 October 2026\, 08:00 to 20 December 2026\, 23:59 (Paris time).\n\nO
 rganisation: France Culture (Radio France) and LaScam (Societe civile des 
 auteurs multimedia)\nLocation: France (remote). Projects must be in French
 \; no residence or nationality condition stated.\nAward: Two writing grant
 s of EUR 5\,000 each. No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: Writing gra
 nt\; target work is a 57'30 documentary for L'Experience on France Culture
  or a native podcast series.\n\nMore: https://www.lascam.fr/lessentiel/bou
 rses-brouillon-dun-reve/bourses-pour-la-creation-de-documentaires-audio-fr
 ance-culture-x-la-scam/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=r
