SUMMARY:Deadline: Creative Europe Journalism Partnerships 2027: Collaborati
 ons and Pluralism (up to EUR 2-2.5 million per project)
DESCRIPTION:Creative Europe's Journalism Partnerships call (CREA-CROSS-2027
 -JOURPART) has two topics supporting the news media sector. COLLABORATIONS
  funds cross-border collaboration and business transformation among news m
 edia organisations\; consortia need at least three independent entities fr
 om three eligible countries. PLURALISM supports journalism sectors of publ
 ic interest (for example local and regional media\, investigative or commu
 nity journalism)\, with at least 60 percent of the grant going to that sec
 tor\, including through re-granting of up to EUR 60\,000 per third party\;
