 r up to EUR 200\,000 plus EUR 100\,000 per extra partner for drama series 
 budgeted at EUR 20 million or more\; total budget EUR 12\,500\,000. APPLIC
 ATION: via the EU Funding and Tenders portal. DEADLINE: 2 March 2027\, 17:
 00 CET (Brussels).\n\nOrganisation: Creative Europe MEDIA (European Commis
 sion / EACEA)\nLocation: EU Member States\, EEA and countries associated t
 o Creative Europe MEDIA. For organisations (legal entities) established in
  a MEDIA country\; natural persons cannot apply. Consortia of at least two
  independent production companies from two MEDIA countries.\nAward: Lump s
 um at a 70 percent funding rate: up to EUR 120\,000 for a two-partner cons
 ortium plus EUR 60\,000 per additional partner\; high-budget drama series 
 (EUR 20 million or more) up to EUR 200\,000 plus EUR 100\,000 per addition
 al partner. Total call budget EUR 12\,500\,000. No application fee.\nDurat
 ion: Projects normally up to 30 months. Call opened 30 September 2026.\n\n
