 ships page. DEADLINE: 30 October 2026.\n\nOrganisation: Foundation for Ame
 rican Innovation (FAI)\nLocation: FAI office on Capitol Hill\, Washington 
 DC\, USA (in person).\nAward: USD 1\,500 stipend for eligible fellows (gov
 ernment employees should check with their ethics office)\, with meals and 
 retreat expenses covered. No application fee.\nDuration: 8 weeks part-time
 \, 19 January to 12 March 2027 (about 2-3 hours a week plus a required wee
 kend retreat in February).\n\nMore: https://www.thefai.org/fellowships?utm
