SUMMARY:Deadline: Asian Cultural Council Organization Grant 2027 (up to USD
  50\,000)
DESCRIPTION:The Asian Cultural Council's Organization Grant funds arts and 
 culture organisations to send participants on cultural exchange between th
 e US and Asia or within Asia. SUPPORT: up to USD 50\,000. ELIGIBILITY: non
 profit organisations\, government-affiliated or sponsored arts and culture
  institutions\, or academic institutions\, legally registered and based in
  an ACC-eligible location (the US and countries across Asia) with at least
  five years of artistic or cultural programming. The activity lead and all
  participants must be citizens or legal permanent residents of an eligible
  location\, though not necessarily the organisation's own. Eligible discip
 lines: architecture\, archaeology\, art history\, arts administration\, ar
 ts criticism\, conservation\, crafts\, curation\, dance\, ethnomusicology\
 , film\, literature\, museum studies\, music\, theater\, visual art. ACC d
 oes not sponsor visas. Applicants may apply to only one ACC programme per 
 cycle. HOW TO APPLY: via the GoApply portal with an Organization Account (
 https://goapply2.akoyago.com/acc/application/ORG2027). Recommendation lett
 ers due 16 November 2026\, 9:59 AM ET. Questions: the ACC office matching 
 your location (Hong Kong\, Japan\, Philippines and Taiwan have their own o
 ffices\; all others application@accny.org). DEADLINE: 10 November 2026\, 9
 :59 AM ET.\n\nOrganisation: Asian Cultural Council\nLocation: Cultural exc
 hange travel between the US and Asia\, or within Asia. For nonprofit\, gov
 ernment-affiliated or academic organisations registered in ACC-eligible lo
 cations.\nAward: Up to USD 50\,000 per organisation for exchange travel by
  its participants. No application fee.\nDuration: 1 to 6 months of travel 
 (at least 30 consecutive days in the US\, or 30 cumulative days in Asia)\,
  with activities between 1 August 2027 and 31 December 2028\n\nMore: https
 ://www.asianculturalcouncil.org/grant-opportunities?utm_source=artificialn
 ouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.asianculturalcouncil.org/grant-opportunities?utm_source=art
 ificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Cultural exchange travel between the US and Asia\, or within Asia.
  For nonprofit\, government-affiliated or academic organisations registere
 d in ACC-eligible locations.
