UID:saha-studio-13th-term-2027@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261031T115742Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261114
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261115
SUMMARY:Deadline: SAHA Studio Open Call\, 13th Term (Istanbul\, up to TRY 2
 00\,000)
DESCRIPTION:SAHA Studio is SAHA Association's research and production resid
 ency in Istanbul. The 13th term selects five professionally practising vis
 ual artists (duos and collectives allowed\; no medium or age requirement) 
 for six months of studio work with a budget\, curatorial feedback\, mid-te
 rm gatherings and a closing 'SAHA Studio Open' presentation. Projects must
  not be preparation for a commercial gallery show. SELECTION: a preliminar
 y jury of seven former residents\, then a Selection and Advisory Board int
 erviews a shortlist of ten\; evaluation runs 15 November to 22 December 20
 26. APPLICATION: one merged PDF (max 7 MB) emailed to sahastudio@saha.org.
 tr with the subject 'SAHA Studio 13 - Application'\, containing the applic
 ation form\, a proposal (max 500 words)\, a draft budget\, a CV (max 2 pag
 es)\, a 10 to 20 page portfolio\, and optional press and a reference lette
 r. DEADLINE: 14 November 2026\, 18:00 Istanbul time (GMT+3).\n\nOrganisati
 on: SAHA Association\nLocation: SAHA's IMC venue\, Fatih\, Istanbul\, Turk
 iye. No nationality rule stated\; aimed at artists working in Turkiye\, wi
 th preference for artists from outside Istanbul.\nAward: Budget of up to T
 RY 200\,000 per artist covering honorarium plus research\, production\, ex
 hibition and event costs. Also a personal studio for 6 months\, accommodat
 ion and transport for artists from outside Istanbul\, equipment and crew s
 upport\, and curatorial\, editorial and legal counselling. 5 artists selec
 ted. No application fee.\nDuration: 6 months (January to June 2027)\n\nMor
 e: https://www.saha.org.tr/en/programs/open-call-from-saha-studio-13th-ter
 m/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.saha.org.tr/en/programs/open-call-from-saha-studio-13th-ter
 m/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:SAHA's IMC venue\, Fatih\, Istanbul\, Turkiye. No nationality rule
  stated\; aimed at artists working in Turkiye\, with preference for artist
 s from outside Istanbul.
END:VEVENT
